## Overview

Lavendre is a curated Minecraft modpack and creative project. This license governs the distribution and use of the modpack as a whole.

Individual mods, resource packs, CIT packs, textures, models, artwork, and all other third-party content included with Lavendre remain the intellectual property of their respective creators and are subject to their own licenses and terms of use.

Nothing in this license overrides, replaces, or modifies the licenses of third-party content.

---

## Permissions

You are permitted to:

- Download and play Lavendre.
- Share the official download page or repository.
- Create videos, livestreams, screenshots, and other media featuring Lavendre.
- Use Lavendre on private or public multiplayer servers.

---

## Restrictions

Unless you have obtained prior written permission from the Lavendre team, you may **not**:

- Redistribute Lavendre or modified versions of the modpack.
- Reupload Lavendre to other websites, launchers, mirrors, or file-hosting services.
- Create and publicly distribute derivative versions or forks of the modpack.
- Sell, monetize, or commercially distribute Lavendre, in whole or in part.
- Remove, alter, or obscure any credits, notices, or attributions included with the modpack.

